:name: ESP32 Buck Converter Co-Simulation
:description: Runs compiled ESP32 firmware with external ngspice co-simulation bridge

using sysbus
mach create "esp32_buck"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @bridge/esp32_buck.repl

# Display UART logging output
showAnalyzer uart0

# Set execution mode to deterministic
emulation SetGlobalQuantum "0.000010"
